'''Madam the Savannah''' (マダム・ザ・サバンナ, ''Madamu・za・Sabanna'', "Madam the Savannah") is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Bride Awakens!]]. She was added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Madam the Savannah
|appearance = [[Bride Awakens!]]
|image = E 252.png
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,925¢
}}

==Enemy==
She has very high health, a crushing attack, fast attack speed, and decent range. However, she has a sluggish attack animation, making it difficult for her to advance. She also survives a lethal strike.

==Strategy==
Bring a lot of meatshields and fast-attacking Cats to defeat her. Alternatively, instead of fast attackers, bringing slow but strong attackers with meatshields can also work against her.

